Contents                tui                                                     
> tui                                                                           
    Quick start         A terminal UI library for Go. Start with the quick start
    Architecture        (#quick-start), or read about the architecture          
    Testing             (#architecture). The source is on GitHub                
                        (https://github.com/ows4444/tui).                       
                                                                                
                        Quick start                                             
                                                                                
                        Write a Model with Init, Update and View, hand it to a  
                        Program, and call Run.                                  
                                                                                
                        [x] a model                                             
                        [x] a program                                           
                        [ ] your idea                                           
                                                                                
                        Architecture                                            
                                                                                
                        A Program owns the terminal and one event loop. Messages
                        go in, a View comes out, and the renderer writes only   
                        what changed. See quick start (#quick-start) again.     
                                                                                
                                                                                
